      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried calling but it just went to voicemail and im really anxious now. i'm pretty sure i'm just overreacting because i've been super sedentary since the surgery. if i just keep the leg up on pillows and keep taking the stuff the doctor gave me, it'll settle down by tomorrow morning, right? i really just want to sleep this off instead of driving to an ER in the middle of the night. it's just a little swelling, it can't be that bad.",
